<title>USA: MLC Holdings names Steven Mencarini CFO.</title>
<headline>MLC Holdings names Steven Mencarini CFO.</headline>
<dateline>RESTON, Va. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>MLC Holdings Inc said Friday it had named Steven Mencarini as chief financial officer and senior vice president.</p>
<p>Mencarini was former controller of the technology management group-outsourcing division of Computer Sciences Corp,  which he joined in 1991 as director of finance, MLC Holdings said.</p>
<p>He will replace as CFO Bruce Bowen who will continue as executive vice president and focus on vendor marketing and government finance, the company said.</p>
</text>
